   "id": "l05-03",
   "audio": "l05-03",
   "say": "Here is the big news of this lesson: to ask a yes/no question you change nothing. No extra word, no different order. You just raise your voice at the end. Say mikhāy biyāy, with your voice going up on the last syllable.",
   "en": "Do you want to come?",
   "fa": "می‌خوای بیای؟",
   "fin": "mikhāy biyāy?",
   "words": [
    {
     "fa": "می‌خوای",
     "fin": "mikhāy",
     "parts": [
      {
       "fin": "mi",
       "role": "prefix",
